# decision record barrier — granularity fixture (mirrors demos/2-effects/s10-barrier-granularity.bqn)
# keys is the .bqn's id column: spawn mints fresh keys from it (6, 7).
# Spawn defaults 1 for nord and dead: ghosts of dead Nords keep Nord and Dead (the .bqn's copies).
# Shared by s10-barrier-granularity-a.ano and s10-barrier-granularity-b.ano.
n 6
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4 5
col nord bool 1 1 0 1 0 0
col dead bool 1 0 0 1 0 1
col ghost bool 0 0 0 0 0 0
default nord 1
default dead 1
ja 北 nord
ja 死 dead
ja 幽霊 ghost
